<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":== integration = (f64 -> f64) -> f64 -> f64 -> f64\n\n:= integral dt : integration =\n    \\ f a b =>\n        := ^ 루프 t y =\n            ? t < b\n            ?> 루프 (t + dt) (y + f t * dt)\n            |: t, y\n        루프 (a + dt / 2) 0\n        |> snd","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :== integration = (f64 -> f64) -> f64 -> f64 -> f64

  := integral dt : integration =
      \ f a b =>
          := ^ 루프 t y =
              ? t < b
              ?> 루프 (t + dt) (y + f t * dt)
              |: t, y
          루프 (a + dt / 2) 0
          |> snd
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

