<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= newton_second_v m fs v0 =\n    fs |> listm::map (\\ f => f v0) |> listm'::sum |> \\ x => x / m\n\n:= update_velocity dt m fs v0 =\n    v0 + newton_second_v m fs v0 * dt\n\n:= velocity_fv dt m v0 fs t =\n    stream::iterate (update_velocity dt m fs) v0\n    |> stream::try_item (t / dt |> math::round |> abs)\n    |> optionm'::default_value 0\n\n:= f_air drag rho area v =\n    -drag * rho * area * abs v * v / 2","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := newton_second_v m fs v0 =
      fs |> listm::map (\ f => f v0) |> listm'::sum |> \ x => x / m

  := update_velocity dt m fs v0 =
      v0 + newton_second_v m fs v0 * dt

  := velocity_fv dt m v0 fs t =
      stream::iterate (update_velocity dt m fs) v0
      |> stream::try_item (t / dt |> math::round |> abs)
      |> optionm'::default_value 0

  := f_air drag rho area v =
      -drag * rho * area * abs v * v / 2
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

