<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= newton_second_tv m fs (t, v0) =\n    := f_net = fs |> listm::map (\\ f => f (t, v0)) |> listm'::sum\n    := acc = f_net / m\n    1, acc\n\n:= update_tv dt m fs (t, v0) =\n    := dtdt, dvdt = newton_second_tv m fs (t, v0)\n    t + dtdt * dt, v0 + dvdt * dt\n\n:= velocity_ftv dt m tv0 fs t =\n    stream::iterate (~~ update_tv dt m fs) tv0\n    |> stream::try_item (t / dt |> math::round |> abs)\n    |> optionm::map snd\n    |> optionm'::default_value 0\n\n:= pedal_coast_air_velocity () =\n    velocity_ftv 0.1 20 (dyn (0, 0)) [ \\ (t, _) => pedal_coast t; \\ (_, v) => f_air 2 1.225 0.5 v ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := newton_second_tv m fs (t, v0) =
      := f_net = fs |> listm::map (\ f => f (t, v0)) |> listm'::sum
      := acc = f_net / m
      1, acc

  := update_tv dt m fs (t, v0) =
      := dtdt, dvdt = newton_second_tv m fs (t, v0)
      t + dtdt * dt, v0 + dvdt * dt

  := velocity_ftv dt m tv0 fs t =
      stream::iterate (~~ update_tv dt m fs) tv0
      |> stream::try_item (t / dt |> math::round |> abs)
      |> optionm::map snd
      |> optionm'::default_value 0

  := pedal_coast_air_velocity () =
      velocity_ftv 0.1 20 (dyn (0, 0)) [ \ (t, _) => pedal_coast t; \ (_, v) => f_air 2 1.225 0.5 v ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

