<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":== vec_derivative = (f64 -> vec) -> f64 -> vec\n\n:= vec_derivative dt : vec_derivative =\n    \\ v t =>\n        (v (t + dt / 2) ^-^ v (t - dt / 2)) ^/ dt","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :== vec_derivative = (f64 -> vec) -> f64 -> vec

  := vec_derivative dt : vec_derivative =
      \ v t =>
          (v (t + dt / 2) ^-^ v (t - dt / 2)) ^/ dt
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

