<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= better_range (theta_deg : f64) (best : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =\n    := best_range, _ = best\n    := range = baseball_range 0.01 45 theta_deg\n    ? range > best_range ?> range, theta_deg |: best\n\n:= best_angle (bounds : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =\n    := min, max = bounds\n    :~ ^ 루프 (theta_deg : f64) (best : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =\n        ? theta_deg > max ?> best |: 루프 (theta_deg + 1) (better_range theta_deg best)\n    루프 min (0f64, min)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := better_range (theta_deg : f64) (best : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =
      := best_range, _ = best
      := range = baseball_range 0.01 45 theta_deg
      ? range > best_range ?> range, theta_deg |: best

  := best_angle (bounds : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =
      := min, max = bounds
      :~ ^ 루프 (theta_deg : f64) (best : f64 * f64) : f64 * f64 =
          ? theta_deg > max ?> best |: 루프 (theta_deg + 1) (better_range theta_deg best)
      루프 min (0f64, min)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

